    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/d46bedcfe11a1df29635449ad1b831ee.avif?t=1732217834\" /></div><br>Ever wanted to dream big and live a peaceful life? Too bad there's always going to be crazy things crashing into your life. And this too applies to the fate of our cute protagonist, Hazuki. Always needing to halt her dreams of becoming a doctor, Hazuki decides to work at a fast food joint to raise funds and continue her studies in the medical field. But the detours keep adding on, as she ends up joining a crazy group of thugs to fight for them. Will she adapt to this new explosive lifestyle? Or will she find a way back to her dreams?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/59202352486e9525db9f882032dc1473.avif?t=1732217834\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play a cute anime girl named Hazuki who has no experience in fighting at all<br></li><li> Experience a non-accurate depiction of being someone with a developing physical disability so you die in one hit for a chunk of the game (you can do this!! I believe in you!!)<br></li><li> Bonk your golf club to the rhythm of the music for extra damage with a freshly cooked original soundtrack<br></li><li> Become friends with a super buff THUG so you learn how to become stronger yourself!!<br></li><li> CUTE GAME!!!<br></li><li> Walk backwards and perform wavedashes in the overworld!!!<br></li><li> LEARN TO BECOME A THUG!!!<br></li><li> THUGS!!!!!<br></li><li> Discover the joys of friendships and why thugs have feelings too!!!!!<br></li><li> YUUTO ICHIKA!!!!!<br></li><li> Gain the understanding of why eating tacos with friends is better than eating tacos alone<br></li><li> Kids love this game!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/5be6d8842981cb4c51f913a1ff7d944b.avif?t=1732217834\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/329c516f20d21f07b79e2fdde615838a.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/329c516f20d21f07b79e2fdde615838a.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Hazuki</strong><br>Worst character in the tier list.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/5405254f198cd5a445d74612c0e5dea2.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/5405254f198cd5a445d74612c0e5dea2.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Quibble</strong><br>He is a super strong thug that loves to punch things until they explode. When he's not punching people, he's preparing all the protein at Mad Meats.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/31f66d458d1f652d64ffb77d6b0438a8.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/31f66d458d1f652d64ffb77d6b0438a8.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>McSoda</strong><br>This homie was known to have a habit of throwing forks at people, but now he found joy in creating his own drinks for customers at Mad Meats.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/baaeb93c60ca711592a8b00dd1645e71.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/baaeb93c60ca711592a8b00dd1645e71.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Knell</strong><br>The fearsome leader of Mad Meats. To atone for his crimes in the past, he is forced to start his own restaurant, but that doesn't stop him from assaulting other restaurants in town.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/46caf0e6a529a51ab282eaf359db5f2c.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/46caf0e6a529a51ab282eaf359db5f2c.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Tanako</strong><br>Very naggy owner of Tanako's Tacos. She is Hazuki's boss. Scary.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/1f786b3a60e1b7bde07c04ce62adc0e8.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/1f786b3a60e1b7bde07c04ce62adc0e8.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>John Smith</strong><br>An ordinary doctor. John is just a doctor. Don't worry about it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/e37a26b6f45e0940715c340bea144be0.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/e37a26b6f45e0940715c340bea144be0.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Gogogogogogogogogogogo</strong><br>A young crab who gives you boat rides. She is rumored to be the daughter of the legendary construction worker, Derek, but she says she's a crab.<br><br>You will meet many more friends along the way. Start your adventure today and decide who you want to go to the bathroom with.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/d46bedcfe11a1df29635449ad1b831ee.avif?t=1732217834\" /></div><br>Ever wanted to dream big and live a peaceful life? Too bad there's always going to be crazy things crashing into your life. And this too applies to the fate of our cute protagonist, Hazuki. Always needing to halt her dreams of becoming a doctor, Hazuki decides to work at a fast food joint to raise funds and continue her studies in the medical field. But the detours keep adding on, as she ends up joining a crazy group of thugs to fight for them. Will she adapt to this new explosive lifestyle? Or will she find a way back to her dreams?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/59202352486e9525db9f882032dc1473.avif?t=1732217834\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play a cute anime girl named Hazuki who has no experience in fighting at all<br></li><li> Experience a non-accurate depiction of being someone with a developing physical disability so you die in one hit for a chunk of the game (you can do this!! I believe in you!!)<br></li><li> Bonk your golf club to the rhythm of the music for extra damage with a freshly cooked original soundtrack<br></li><li> Become friends with a super buff THUG so you learn how to become stronger yourself!!<br></li><li> CUTE GAME!!!<br></li><li> Walk backwards and perform wavedashes in the overworld!!!<br></li><li> LEARN TO BECOME A THUG!!!<br></li><li> THUGS!!!!!<br></li><li> Discover the joys of friendships and why thugs have feelings too!!!!!<br></li><li> YUUTO ICHIKA!!!!!<br></li><li> Gain the understanding of why eating tacos with friends is better than eating tacos alone<br></li><li> Kids love this game!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/5be6d8842981cb4c51f913a1ff7d944b.avif?t=1732217834\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/329c516f20d21f07b79e2fdde615838a.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/329c516f20d21f07b79e2fdde615838a.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Hazuki</strong><br>Worst character in the tier list.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/5405254f198cd5a445d74612c0e5dea2.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/5405254f198cd5a445d74612c0e5dea2.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Quibble</strong><br>He is a super strong thug that loves to punch things until they explode. When he's not punching people, he's preparing all the protein at Mad Meats.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/31f66d458d1f652d64ffb77d6b0438a8.poster.avif?t=1732217834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228000/extras/31f66d458d1f652d64ffb77d6b0438a8.webm?t=1732217834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>McSoda</strong><br>This homie was known to have a habit of throwing forks at people, but now he found joy in creating his own drinks for customers at Mad Meats.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossori